{"id":"496251","name":"五指毛桃煲鸡汤","author":"海之韵美食记","authorId":"1323220","desc":"","cover":"images/496251/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五指毛桃","amount":"80g"},{"name":"鸡","amount":"半只"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"150g"},{"name":"芡实","amount":"30g"},{"name":"淮山","amount":"40g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"5个"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"2块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"五指毛桃清水干净，再浸泡10分钟。","img":"images/496251/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣去核，其它食材均洗干净。","img":"images/496251/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡肉和瘦肉均用热水焯烫，去除浮沫，再用水冲干净。","img":"images/496251/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"全部材料放进汤煲，加入清水。","img":"images/496251/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火煮沸，再次撇去浮沫。","img":"images/496251/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"转中小火煲90分钟，最后加盐调味即可。","img":"images/496251/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}